    "text": "Part 2."
  },
  {
    "id": "c3",
    "startMs": 6320,
    "endMs": 6580,
    "text": "Listening."
  },
  {
    "id": "c4",
    "startMs": 6920,
    "endMs": 7580,
    "text": "Ting Li Buffen."
  },
  {
    "id": "c5",
    "startMs": 8840,
    "endMs": 9720,
    "text": "Listen and number."
  },
  {
    "id": "c6",
    "startMs": 10220,
    "endMs": 11920,
    "text": "Xiaopon Yeomansai Thalu Rejama."
  },
  {
    "id": "c7",
    "startMs": 12360,
    "endMs": 12840,
    "text": "Ting Li Ying."
  },
  {
    "id": "c8",
    "startMs": 13240,
    "endMs": 14380,
    "text": "Keng Jie Ting Thal Da Shrenshu."
  },
  {
    "id": "c9",
    "startMs": 14860,
    "endMs": 15900,
    "text": "Yeong Ita Wu."
  },
  {
    "id": "c10",
    "startMs": 16360,
    "endMs": 16420,
    "text": "Okay."
  },
  {
    "id": "c11",
    "startMs": 16640,
    "endMs": 17600,
    "text": "Sallet Wu Pianpian Hao."
  },
  {
    "id": "c12",
    "startMs": 18420,
    "endMs": 19460,
    "text": "1."
  },
  {
    "id": "c13",
    "startMs": 20300,
    "endMs": 21060,
    "text": "What are you making?"
  },
  {
    "id": "c14",
    "startMs": 22160,
    "endMs": 23440,
    "text": "I'm painting in the art club."
  },
  {
    "id": "c15",
    "startMs": 24080,
    "endMs": 25540,
    "text": "2."
  },
  {
    "id": "c16",
    "startMs": 26380,
    "endMs": 27220,
    "text": "Look at my new book."
  },
  {
    "id": "c17",
    "startMs": 27580,
    "endMs": 28300,
    "text": "It's about whales."
  },
  {
    "id": "c18",
    "startMs": 29040,
    "endMs": 29300,
    "text": "Wow!"
  },
  {
    "id": "c19",
    "startMs": 29960,
    "endMs": 30720,
    "text": "Where did you get it?"
  },
  {
    "id": "c20",
    "startMs": 31180,
    "endMs": 32600,
    "text": "I borrowed it from the library."
  },
  {
    "id": "c21",
    "startMs": 33580,
    "endMs": 37520,
    "text": "3. Look at me! I can do Kung Fu actions!"
  },
  {
    "id": "c22",
    "startMs": 38160,
    "endMs": 38520,
    "text": "Great!"
  },
  {
    "id": "c23",
    "startMs": 39960,
    "endMs": 41860,
    "text": "4. What's the matter?"
  },
  {
    "id": "c24",
    "startMs": 42560,
    "endMs": 44620,
    "text": "A 2. I think I have a runny nose."
  },
  {
    "id": "c25",
    "startMs": 45770,
    "endMs": 48400,
    "text": "5. Is it your birthday today?"
  },
  {
    "id": "c26",
    "startMs": 48740,
    "endMs": 51100,
    "text": "Yes. Look at my birthday cake!"
  },
  {
    "id": "c27",
    "startMs": 51740,
    "endMs": 54540,
    "text": "2. Listen and choose."
  },
  {
    "id": "c28",
    "startMs": 55100,
    "endMs": 55640,
    "text": "Ting yin,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c29",
    "startMs": 56060,
    "endMs": 58820,
    "text": "peng ji ting tah the wen ji huot shim jing viao shu,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c30",
    "startMs": 59160,
    "endMs": 60490,
    "text": "chen chuotu e tat an de yindaju."
  },
  {
    "id": "c31",
    "startMs": 61800,
    "endMs": 65060,
    "text": "1. What are you going to do in the art club?"
  },
  {
    "id": "c32",
    "startMs": 66140,
    "endMs": 69340,
    "text": "2. What's special about the water lily?"
  },
  {
    "id": "c33",
    "startMs": 70710,
    "endMs": 74320,
    "text": "3. I have a fever and a bat cough."
  },
  {
    "id": "c34",
    "startMs": 75480,
    "endMs": 79600,
    "text": "4. How did the students perform the dragon dance?"
  },
  {
    "id": "c35",
    "startMs": 81440,
    "endMs": 85720,
    "text": "5. I used my phone too long and my eyes are red."
  },
  {
    "id": "c36",
    "startMs": 86840,
    "endMs": 89080,
    "text": "3. Listen and choose."
  },
  {
    "id": "c37",
    "startMs": 89700,
    "endMs": 91460,
    "text": "10. Tell me about the phone."
  },
  {
    "id": "c38",
    "startMs": 91820,
    "endMs": 93340,
    "text": "I'll tell you how to do it."
  },
  {
    "id": "c39",
    "startMs": 94320,
    "endMs": 95760,
    "text": "I'll do it."
  },
  {
    "id": "c40",
    "startMs": 97260,
    "endMs": 97880,
    "text": "Dialogue 1."
  },
  {
    "id": "c41",
    "startMs": 98880,
    "endMs": 100120,
    "text": "Which is your favourite month,"
  },
  {
    "id": "c42",
    "startMs": 100760,
    "endMs": 101160,
    "text": "Tom?"
  },
  {
    "id": "c43",
    "startMs": 101580,
    "endMs": 102760,
    "text": "I like October best."
  },
  {
    "id": "c44",
    "startMs": 103540,
    "endMs": 103880,
    "text": "Why?"
  },
  {
    "id": "c45",
    "startMs": 104740,
    "endMs": 106700,
    "text": "Because my birthday is in October."
  },
  {
    "id": "c46",
    "startMs": 107360,
    "endMs": 108980,
    "text": "I can have a party and get presents."
  },
  {
    "id": "c47",
    "startMs": 111340,
    "endMs": 114620,
    "text": "Question 1. What is Tom's favourite month?"
  },
  {
    "id": "c48",
    "startMs": 116210,
    "endMs": 120600,
    "text": "Question 2. Why does Tom like it?"
  },
  {
